browser_vision attaches the screenshot for a main model with native vision.

Symptom: on the Camofox backend browser_vision always sent the screenshot to
the auxiliary vision model and returned its text, even for Claude or p0's
Qwen, which can look at it themselves; core's browser_exec (agent-browser /
browser-use) attaches its screenshots natively for such models.
Fix: when tools.vision_tools._should_use_native_vision_fast_path() holds
(hermes' one gate for images in tool results, which the core patch
hermes-vision-every-model makes per main model), return the multimodal
tool result (resized like vision_analyze's native embed); else, or on any
failure, describe as before. Was hunk 2 of hermes-vision-every-model while
Camofox lived in core (v0.22.5). Not upstream.

